Package: devjam-system-config
Version: 1.26-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Recommends: hstr
Description: Generic configs by devjam
 General system settings: timestamps in the shell history, default bash
 aliases and profile for new users, bash drop-in snippets in
 /etc/bashrc.d (history size, hstr on Ctrl-R) loaded through
 ~/.bash_aliases together with ~/.config/bashrc.d, Geany defaults,
 high-quality PipeWire resampling, TRIM/discard for SSDs and LUKS
 volumes, storage tuning, a shorter stop timeout for systemd user
 services, and switch-io to choose an I/O scheduler preset.
